### E2E Health Check (Public)
# Verifies REST mapping, PostgreSQL connection status, and transaction-bound auditing fields
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Actuator Health (Public)
# Returns liveness, readiness, and basic component checks
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Actuator Prometheus Metrics (Public)
# Returns system and custom metrics formatted for Prometheus scrapers
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

### OpenAPI Specifications JSON (Public)
# Exposes the OpenAPI v3 spec models for generating clients
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### Secured Route Verification (Expects 401 Unauthorized ErrorResponse)
# Verifies that security configurations block requests lacking authentication tokens
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incidents
Accept: application/json
